      "slug": "plugin-upgrade",
      "title": "Plugin Upgrade"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "id": "0c31e87d9610a94d",
      "text": "# See"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "id": "6721c49eb7c8d539",
      "text": "- [[About Assets Plugin]] \u2014 what the item does\n- [[About Reserved Asset Paths]] \u2014 folders with a special meaning"
    }
